      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "冬天举办的“冠军杯”。\n在观众众多的中央GⅠ跑赢的话，\n一定能受到更多人的瞩目。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e85b50b5252e95113541dddcd58b120b3bb753c0b0f033dc01062a752149cd95",
